<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a73e8 0%, #0d47a1 100%);
      padding: 32px 40px;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .body {
      padding: 36px 40px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .body p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }
    .bio-section {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-left: 3px solid #1a73e8;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.5;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    .highlight {
      color: #1a73e8;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    a{
      color: #1a73e8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>很高興在「{{ event_name }}」認識你！</h1>
      <p>來自 {{ sender_name }} 的問候</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p>嗨，親愛的 <span class="highlight">{{ recipient_name }}{% if recipient_title %} {{ recipient_title }}{% endif %}</span>，</p>

      <p>
        我是 <strong>{{ sender_name }}</strong>，很榮幸有機會在
        <span class="highlight">{{ event_name }}</span> 認識你。
        交流過後，想再次透過這封信表達我的誠意，也希望後續有更多機會深入交流。
      </p>

      <hr class="divider">

      <p><strong>關於我：</strong></p>
      <div class="bio-section">{{ sender_bio | safe }}</div>

      <hr class="divider">

      <p>
        希望很快就能有機會與
        <span class="highlight">{{ company_name }}</span> 合作！
        如有任何想法或合作機會，隨時歡迎回信給我。
      </p>

      <p>期待與你的下一次交流 🤝</p>

      <p>
        {{ sender_name }} 敬上
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        此信件由名片問候助理(<a href="https://github.com/ayuhamaro/card-greeter" target="_blank">GitHub Repo</a>)自動生成 · {{ event_name }}
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
